CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/bq com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/UnitTypeReferenceCondition
	COMMENT One entry of a unit list ("spawnUnits"/"produceUnits"/"attachments_addNewUnits"/... ini key): unitType (LazyUnitTypeReference), spawnSource (LogicBoolean selecting the spawning unit), copyWaypointsFrom (LogicBoolean), count ("unitName*N"), neutralTeam/aggressiveTeam/setToTeamOfLastAttacker (mutually exclusive, validated), spawnChance, maxSpawnLimit, gridAlign, skipIfOverlapping, falling, techLevel, alwayStartDirAtZero, offsetX/offsetY/offsetHeight/offsetDir/offsetRandomX/offsetRandomY/offsetRandomDir, addResources (CustomPrice granted via h(unit)), transportedUnitsToTransfer (short). All field names come from the ini parameter names parsed in UnitSpawner.b(...) which assigns them one by one.
	FIELD a unitType Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/v;
	FIELD b spawnSource Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/logicBooleans/LogicBoolean;
	FIELD c copyWaypointsFrom Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/logicBooleans/LogicBoolean;
	FIELD d count I
	FIELD e neutralTeam Z
	FIELD f aggressiveTeam Z
	FIELD g setToTeamOfLastAttacker Z
	FIELD h spawnChance F
	FIELD i maxSpawnLimit I
	FIELD j gridAlign Z
	FIELD k skipIfOverlapping Z
	FIELD l falling Z
	FIELD m techLevel I
	FIELD n alwayStartDirAtZero Z
	FIELD o offsetX F
	FIELD p offsetY F
	FIELD q offsetHeight F
	FIELD r offsetDir F
	FIELD s offsetRandomX F
	FIELD t offsetRandomY F
	FIELD u offsetRandomDir F
	FIELD v addResources Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/d/b;
	FIELD w transportedUnitsToTransfer S
